  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot \u015Fimdi sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "\u015Eimdi i\xE7in \"De\u011Fnek Dokuzlusu\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nSava\u015F\u0131
    b\u0131rak\u0131yor musun {{isim}}, hay\u0131rd\u0131r? Se\xE7ti\u011Fin kart,
    m\xFCcadele alan\u0131n\u0131 terk etmeyi d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC
    s\xF6yl\xFCyor. Dikkatsizce yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n hatalar cesaretini k\u0131r\u0131yor.
    Kendi potansiyelini unutuyor, hayallerine eri\u015Fmenin imkans\u0131zla\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    art\u0131k san\u0131r\u0131m kabul ediyorsun. Oyundan \xE7\u0131kmamal\u0131s\u0131n.
    Meydan\u0131, bunu yapman\u0131 isteyenlere bo\u015F b\u0131rakmamal\u0131s\u0131n.
    Hata yapmaktan korkarak temkinli davran\u0131rken, hi\xE7 yapmamak ya da yapmaktan
    vazge\xE7mek de neyin nesi? Ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar, seni bezdirmek i\xE7in el birli\u011Fi
    ile u\u011Fra\u015F\u0131yor. Y\xFCz\xFCp y\xFCz\xFCp kuyru\u011Funa gelmi\u015Fken,
    d\xFC\u015Fledi\u011Fin \u015Feylerin sonunu g\xF6rmeden d\xFC\u011Fmeye bas\u0131p
    her \u015Feyi \xF6ylece kapatamazs\u0131n."
